            "title": "Finally Starting Feels Possible",
            "content": "<p>I’ve tried supplements, routines, apps and nothing ever stuck. I’ve been using Dopamine Patches for about three months now, and the biggest difference is that starting tasks doesn’t feel painful anymore. I’m not suddenly super productive. I just don’t feel blocked all day.</p>"
