            "title": "Less Resistance. More Follow-Through.",
            "content": "<p>I have ADHD and motivation has always been inconsistent. Some days I’m on fire, most days I’m not. After using these patches for a few months, my days feel more even. Less mental resistance. That alone is a huge win for me.</p>"
